# Compiled models from Infer.NET
# CompiledModels/ is COMMITTED on purpose: it carries the precompiled
# RobustSudokuModel (.cs source + .dll) so the PrecompiledRobustSudokuModel
# preload path (DLL first, .cs compile fallback, from-scratch last) works
# out of the box on a fresh clone instead of paying the first-run compile.
# GeneratedSource/ stays ignored: intermediate compiler scratch (multiple
# stale Model*_EP.cs versions), the curated artifact lives in CompiledModels/.
GeneratedSource/
*.jar
